{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snow War is a <strong>First Person Snowball</strong> game. No blood, no gore \u2014 just pure, chaotic fun where every hit counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/5a827e94e8aa43232ab5efdba8b3cb87.poster.avif?t=1769784000\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/5a827e94e8aa43232ab5efdba8b3cb87.webm?t=1769784000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/5a827e94e8aa43232ab5efdba8b3cb87.mp4?t=1769784000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find gadgets that protect you, boost your throws, or give you a temporary edge. Use them wisely \u2014 batteries don\u2019t last forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/db4bd3d539fc64c7c8e4e3f6d8097052.poster.avif?t=1769784000\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/db4bd3d539fc64c7c8e4e3f6d8097052.webm?t=1769784000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/db4bd3d539fc64c7c8e4e3f6d8097052.mp4?t=1769784000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what are you waiting for? Battle across neon\u2011lit cities and pine\u2011covered forests. Climb the scoreboard and prove you\u2019re the champion of the frozen wasteland.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2744\ufe0f <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic PvP FPS (First Person Snowball) action for up to 16 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free\u2011for\u2011all mode (team modes planned)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online or LAN play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline bots for practice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of power\u2011ups that change the flow of battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom servers with adjustable rules</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1585100?t=1769784000","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1585100?t=1769784000","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/cf1a8d4d0c302ca2bfd1f448fad363c2d04305c1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769784000","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/cf1a8d4d0c302ca2bfd1f448fad363c2d04305c1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769784000","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Early Access Soon!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are excited to announce that after years of working the game, we are very near of releasing to the Early Access. We want the experience to smooth as ice, so just hang tight for a bit, and you'll be playing in no time! Wishlist now and we\u2019ll let you know the moment the snowballs start flying.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snow War is a <strong>First Person Snowball</strong> game. No blood, no gore \u2014 just pure, chaotic fun where every hit counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/5a827e94e8aa43232ab5efdba8b3cb87.poster.avif?t=1769784000\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/5a827e94e8aa43232ab5efdba8b3cb87.webm?t=1769784000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/5a827e94e8aa43232ab5efdba8b3cb87.mp4?t=1769784000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find gadgets that protect you, boost your throws, or give you a temporary edge. Use them wisely \u2014 batteries don\u2019t last forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/db4bd3d539fc64c7c8e4e3f6d8097052.poster.avif?t=1769784000\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/db4bd3d539fc64c7c8e4e3f6d8097052.webm?t=1769784000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/db4bd3d539fc64c7c8e4e3f6d8097052.mp4?t=1769784000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what are you waiting for? Battle across neon\u2011lit cities and pine\u2011covered forests. Climb the scoreboard and prove you\u2019re the champion of the frozen wasteland.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2744\ufe0f <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic PvP FPS (First Person Snowball) action for up to 16 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free\u2011for\u2011all mode (team modes planned)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online or LAN play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline bots for practice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of power\u2011ups that change the flow of battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom servers with adjustable rules</p></li></ul>","developers":["Gnomecraft"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/97500e1769dca755ff04d143f79a66a95233b7f5/header.jpg?t=1769784000","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright Gnomecraft.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 25.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 4000 series or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 660 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 16 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 25.10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7 2700X or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 1080 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 16 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1585100/9533716/df191af43775282028f57b907ce7be8f526f5145/1765548695/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766082160","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1585100/9533716/df191af43775282028f57b9